			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740450401,
					"content": "歡迎光臨，這裡是全楓丹廷寶石種類最齊全的商鋪，還有各類工藝品出售。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450402,
					"content": "#有什麼{F#妳}{M#你}們看得上眼的東西嗎？沒有的話要是有什麼其他想要的也儘管問我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450403,
					"content": "我們手上有些神奇的礦石…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450404,
					"content": "嗯嗯，既然是寶石種類最齊全的商鋪，那你一定也會清楚我們手上礦石的價值囉！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450405,
					"content": "#哦哦，原來{F#妳}{M#你}們是來兜售礦石的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450406,
					"content": "#那{F#妳}{M#你}們這就找對人了，我這裡的收購價格，可以說是童叟無欺。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450407,
					"content": "那麼，是什麼樣的礦石呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450408,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}將之前找到的奇異礦石拿出來交給了切瑟爾查看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450409,
					"content": "這…沒想到竟然是連我也沒看過的礦石…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450410,
					"content": "不過這奇異的色澤、這光滑的質地…絕對是非常珍稀的品類沒錯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450411,
					"content": "雖然這樣說不太好意思，不過恕我見識短淺，敢問這到底是什麼礦石呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450412,
						740450414,
						740450416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450412,
					"content": "我也不清楚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450413
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450413,
					"content": "#所以{F#妳}{M#你}們才來找我鑑定的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450419,
					"content": "不過這樣的礦石竟然只有一塊，實在可惜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450420,
					"content": "如果能有足夠的貨源，說不定就可以打磨製作出足以風靡整個楓丹的飾品了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450421,
					"content": "（我記得芙佳說過這樣的石頭在礦脈附近到處都是，要是問問她的話…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450422,
						740450424,
						740450427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450422,
					"content": "這樣的礦石我們還有不少。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450423
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450423,
					"content": "真的嗎，那真是太好了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450430,
					"content": "#既然這樣的話，{F#妳}{M#你}們手上的礦石我願意買下，並且我還想透過{F#妳}{M#你}們的管道購入更多的礦石，來製作一批工藝品。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450431,
					"content": "#當然為表誠意，貨款我會提前預付給{F#妳}{M#你}們，只要下次來的時候{F#妳}{M#你}們能把更多的礦石帶給我就好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450432
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450432,
					"content": "#怎麼樣，我覺得是筆公平的交易，不知{F#妳}{M#你}們意下如何？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450433
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450433,
					"content": "嘿嘿，我也覺得不錯，那就成交啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450434
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450434,
					"content": "#那真的是太好了，這是給{F#妳}{M#你}們的貨款…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450435
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450435,
					"content": "這樣的寶石能做出什麼樣的飾品呢，哈哈，我都已經開始期待了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450436
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450436,
					"content": "那麼我就在此靜候佳音了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450424,
					"content": "貨源可是商業機密。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450425,
					"content": "哦哦，這是當然…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450426,
					"content": "#不過，只要{F#妳}{M#你}們有進貨的管道那就太好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450427,
					"content": "其實在「厄里那斯」那裡就有很多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450428
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450428,
					"content": "#喂，{F#妳}{M#你}怎麼直接告訴他了啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450429,
					"content": "原來是從「厄里那斯」那裡找到的嗎？的確通常不會有人深入那裡尋找礦脈…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450414,
					"content": "可能是叫「派派石」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450415
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450415,
					"content": "什麼啦，不要取奇怪的名字吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450416,
					"content": "當然是叫「閃耀的琉璃色金」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450417
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450417,
					"content": "#唔，是{F#妳}{M#你}剛編出來的名字嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450418,
					"content": "竟然是叫這麼厲害的名字，難怪看起來會這麼特殊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟爾"
				}
			]
